            "review_title": "Review at 7 Nị Quán",
            "review_text": "Susan A\naberdeen52 contributions\n0\nInexperienced staff, very disappointing service & food.\nMar 2025 • Couples\nHaving waited an hour to receive our food one item was missing-spare ribs. Bringing it to the staff’s attention was a complete waste of time. We had eaten all our other dishes & was ready to leave. Finally a dish arrived bearing no resemblance to the photo on their menu. Tough, tasteless & not cooked. Don’t waste your money here! Terrible service, terrible staff & terrible food.\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2025",
